	(text "CHARGER: BQ25798 standalone (no MCU), USB-C 5 V sink"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "14d84408-c7c5-4aca-81a0-3dc122da9905")
	)
	(text "PROTECTOR: HY2120-LB, 2S, low-side FETs; HY2213 balancers"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 170.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7df3a412-c789-472b-a798-121616a7fec2")
	)
	(text "USB-C is a plain 5 V sink: R95/R96 5.1k Rd on CC1/CC2, no PD. D+/D- go to the BQ25798 for BC1.2 detection.\nBC1.2 input limits (datasheet Table 7-4): SDP 0.5 A, CDP 1.5 A, DCP 3.25 A, unknown 3 A, non-standard 1-2.4 A.\nThe ILIM_HIZ pin clamps every result. HVDCP, 9 V and 12 V requests are off at power-on, so VBUS stays at 5 V.\nD1 SMBJ20A clamps VBUS. SBU is unused."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 243.84 162.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5cd1866c-cfb6-4604-90cd-c054b9ad3410")
	)
	(text "CHARGE SAFETY WITHOUT FIRMWARE (BQ25798 SLUSDV2C, checked 2026-10-19)\nPROG: R31 8.2k + R78 0 = 8.2k selects 2S (8.4 V) at 750 kHz (Table 7-1). /CE to PACK-: always charging.\nPower-on defaults: ICHG 1 A, VSYSMIN 7 V, precharge 120 mA, termination 200 mA, 12 h safety timer, JEITA, ADC off.\nILIM_HIZ: V = 1 V + 0.8 Ohm x ILIM. R32 39k / R33 18k from REGN (4.8 V typ) = 1.52 V -> ILIM 0.65 A.\nCharge at 90 % efficiency: about 0.42 A at 3.5 V/cell (about 1C for 450 mAh). Re-pick R33 for other cells.\nICHG stays at its 1 A default with no host, so this divider is the only rate limit.\nTS: R34 5.23k / R35 30.1k with TH2 (10k NTC, B25/85 3434): cutoffs 0 C and 60 C within 1 C. TH2 against the cells.\nI2C unused: SCL/SDA pulled to REGN by R97/R98 10k (datasheet: 10k to the logic rail). /INT and /QON open.\nSTAT drives LED1 (0805 top view, lit while charging; blinks on a fault).\nCharger BAT sits on PACK+ after F1; SYS only has its caps."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 243.84 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9d02e1dd-0804-4f2a-9c8e-9be16f0cfd6e")
	)
	(text "HY2120-LB (HYCON DS-HY2120-V15): OV 4.25 V (release 4.05 V), UV 2.80 V (release 3.00 V) per cell; power-down on.\nCurrent is sensed as the drop across Q2 + Q3 on CS (no shunt): discharge OC 200 mV (10 ms), short 1.0 V (250 us), charge OC -210 mV.\nWith Q2 + Q3 at about 10 mOhm that is about 18-20 A, lower when the FETs are hot. F1 15 A: CELL+ -> PACK+ (J2 pin 2).\nFilters per datasheet: R61/C62 470 + 100n on VDD (from CELL+), R63/C64 470 + 100n on VC (from the mid tap), R74 2k on CS.\nPath: cell - (BAT_N, J3 pin 1) -> Q2 (OD, discharge) -> Q3 (OC, charge) -> PACK- (J2 pin 1). No temperature input: TH2 covers charging only.\nOver-current clears when CS falls back under 200 mV with the load gone. R94 4.7k PACK- to BAT_N holds CS at about 80 mV\nwith the charger's 17 uA standby draw, so a trip clears when the pack is unplugged or the brain's switch goes off.\nBalancing: U21 (cell 1) and U22 (cell 2) HY2213-BB3A turn Q4/Q5 on above 4.200 V; R112/R113 47R bleed about 89 mA.\nBalance lead J11 (B3B-XH-A): pin 1 cell 1-, pin 2 mid, pin 3 cell 2+."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 284.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e68af004-02e8-4cdf-ba6c-bdc151a6a9e6")
	)
	(text "J3 XT30UPB-M: the cells' own XT30U-F plugs in (cell leads stay uncut).\nJ2: pads for a 16 AWG lead with an XT30U-F that mates the brain's J3.\nHand-placed (DNP for PCBA): L2, Q2, Q3, TH2, F1; hand-soldered: J2, J3, J11."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 264.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a723f0e1-b078-4619-979c-d87a76b8402f")
	)
